msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fettec-onewire.rst:50
#: 70085298e2af4be3a5b1e3dc9427b139
msgid "FETtec ESC configurator software"
msgstr "FETtec ESC 配置软件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fettec-onewire.rst:52
#: e9f4ba1e044542bdb2f065ac70849f06
msgid ""
"The `FETtec ESC configurator <https://github.com/FETtec/ESC-"
"Configurator/releases>`_ can change all ESC's settings and do ESC firmware "
"updates. Use it to make sure, that your ESC Firmware Version is 2.17 "
"(September 2021) or later. Typically a FETtec autopilot can be used as a "
"USB<->OneWire bridge so that the *FETtec ESC configurator* can communicate "
"with the ESCs. ESC's parameter changes and ESC firmware updates are also "
"made via OneWire so a serial passthrough is possible. Often used parameters "
"are for example:"
msgstr ""
"`FETtec ESC 配置工具 <https://github.com/FETtec/ESC-Configurator/releases>`_ "
"可更改所有 ESC 设置并进行 ESC 固件更新。请使用它确认您的 ESC 固件版本为 2.17（2021 年 9 月）或更新版本。通常可以将 "
"FETtec 飞控用作 USB 转 OneWire 桥接器，使 *FETtec ESC 配置工具* 能够与 ESC 通信。ESC "
"参数更改和固件更新也通过 OneWire 进行，因此可以使用串口直通方式。常用参数例如："

#: ../../source/docs/common-fettec-onewire.rst:58
#: 6ddb971bd31d44a0996744b38c180df0
msgid ""
"**Motor direction** - If your motor spins in the wrong direction you can "
"change it easily without rewiring"
msgstr "**电机方向** - 如果电机旋转方向错误，无需重新接线即可轻松更改"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fettec-onewire.rst:59
#: 7ac3c07d9ad84d9ea4cfb0ccea7d8b90
msgid "**Motor beeps** - Enables or disables motor beeps"
msgstr "**电机蜂鸣** - 启用或禁用电机蜂鸣声"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fettec-onewire.rst:60
#: acbe187670ff4bc7ad95407ec1e248e6
msgid ""
"**Soft brake** - If you have props that \"unscrew\" if they are stopped too "
"fast you can use the softbreak option."
msgstr "**软制动** - 如果螺旋桨在停止过快时会「松脱」，可使用软制动选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fettec-onewire.rst:61
#: 193c6286c1c5452fbb1e75242ce67ea1
msgid ""
"**ESC IDs** - The IDs of each ESC. These must start at 1, be unique and be "
"contiguous."
msgstr "**ESC ID** - 每个 ESC 的 ID。这些 ID 必须从 1 开始，唯一且连续。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fettec-onewire.rst:64
#: b2abcad13d504bceae098a363a171988
msgid "IDs inside the ESCs"
msgstr "ESC 内部的 ID"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fettec-onewire.rst:66
#: 2a8abcf09f3d4db8ba91e480e1b4dd0b
msgid ""
"Each ESC has it's own ID, which can be configured by the FETtec ESC "
"Configuration tool described above. These IDs must start at ID 1 and "
"increase without a gap (be in a single contiguous block). Duplicate IDs are "
"invalid. If two or more 4in1 ESCs should be connected, the IDs of the second"
" and third ESC have to be changed before they are connected, otherwise you "
"will have duplicated IDs."
msgstr ""
"每个 ESC 都有自己的 ID，可通过上述 FETtec ESC 配置工具进行配置。这些 ID 必须从 1 开始连续递增（不得有间隔）。重复 ID "
"无效。如果需要连接两个或更多 4 合 1 ESC，必须在连接之前更改第二和第三个 ESC 的 ID，否则会出现重复 ID。"

