#: ../../source/docs/common-fettec-onewire.rst:107
#: 2de073bcaf4144f28570d068b40a8286
msgid ""
"The :ref:`SERVO_FTW_MASK<SERVO_FTW_MASK>` parameter selects which servo "
"outputs, if any, will be routed to FETtec ESCs. You need to reboot after "
"changing this parameter. Only SERVO1_FUNCTION to SERVO12_FUNCTION can be "
"routed using the :ref:`SERVO_FTW_MASK<SERVO_FTW_MASK>`. You do not need to "
"change the FETtec IDs inside the ESCs if you change the servo output "
"assignments inside ArduPilot the using the "
":ref:`SERVO_FTW_MASK<SERVO_FTW_MASK>` parameter."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERVO_FTW_MASK<SERVO_FTW_MASK>` 参数用于选择哪些舵机输出（如有）将路由到 FETtec "
"ESC。更改此参数后需要重启。只有 SERVO1_FUNCTION 到 SERVO12_FUNCTION 可以通过 "
":ref:`SERVO_FTW_MASK<SERVO_FTW_MASK>` 路由。在 ArduPilot 中使用 "
":ref:`SERVO_FTW_MASK<SERVO_FTW_MASK>` 参数更改舵机输出分配时，无需更改 ESC 内部的 FETtec ID。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fettec-onewire.rst:112
#: 222cb042e723441e9c8681b1df87efe0
msgid ""
"After that you must set the servo output channels you want to use in the "
":ref:`SERVO_FTW_MASK<SERVO_FTW_MASK>` parameter, and again restart your "
"autopilot. For example, a quadcopter using the first four motors would need "
"the first four bits of the bitmask set:"
msgstr ""
"之后，必须在 :ref:`SERVO_FTW_MASK<SERVO_FTW_MASK>` "
"参数中设置要使用的舵机输出通道，并再次重启飞控。例如，使用前四个电机的四旋翼需要设置位图的前四位："

#: ../../source/docs/common-fettec-onewire.rst:114
#: 1b2f10bc60ee4581937c2bec26990b66
msgid ":ref:`SERVO_FTW_MASK<SERVO_FTW_MASK>` = 15"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO_FTW_MASK<SERVO_FTW_MASK>` = 15"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fettec-onewire.rst:116
#: b48f4565d1514df3995b9e81e53e2dca
msgid ""
"Each bit of the mask describes whether a motor is attached and should be "
"used with oneWire. The value is configured decimal and is the sum of the "
"decimal equivalent of each set bit. Bit 1 corresponds to 2^1 = 1, Bit 2 "
"corresponds to 2^2 = 2,... . E.g. if you have connected Motor 1,2,3,4 the "
"mask is 1+2+4+8 = 15."
msgstr ""
"掩码的每一位表示是否连接了电机且应通过 OneWire 使用。该值以十进制配置，是每个置位的十进制等效值之和。位 1 对应 2^1 = 1，位 2 对应"
" 2^2 = 2，……例如，连接电机 1、2、3、4 时掩码为 1+2+4+8 = 15。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fettec-onewire.rst:118
#: eca3474325964bf6888770215a6752d5
msgid ""
"Simply sum the decimal values for the motors connected or read it from the "
"list below."
msgstr "直接累加已连接电机的十进制值，或从下表查阅。"

