msgid ""
"The :ref:`SERVO_FTW_RVMASK<SERVO_FTW_RVMASK>` parameter selects which "
"outputs, if any, will reverse their rotation. This parameter effects the "
"outputs immediately when changed and the motors are not armed. This "
"parameter is only visible if the :ref:`SERVO_FTW_MASK<SERVO_FTW_MASK>` "
"parameter has at least one bit set."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERVO_FTW_RVMASK<SERVO_FTW_RVMASK>` "
"参数用于选择哪些输出（如有）将反转旋转方向。更改此参数后，在电机未解锁时立即生效。只有当 "
":ref:`SERVO_FTW_MASK<SERVO_FTW_MASK>` 参数至少有一位被置位时，此参数才可见。"

