msgid ""
"Each bit of the mask describes whether a motor is rotation direction should "
"be reversed. The value is configured decimal and is the sum of the decimal "
"equivalent of each set bit. Bit 0 (first ESC) corresponds to 2^0 = 1, Bit 1 "
"(second ESC) corresponds to 2^1 = 2, ... ."
msgstr ""
"掩码的每一位表示该电机的旋转方向是否应反转。该值以十进制配置，是每个置位的十进制等效值之和。位 0（第一个 ESC）对应 2^0 = 1，位 1（第二个"
" ESC）对应 2^1 = 2，……"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fettec-onewire.rst:164
