"The :ref:`SERVO_FTW_POLES<SERVO_FTW_POLES>` parameter selects Number of "
"motor electrical poles. It is used to calculate the motors RPM This "
"parameter effects the RPM calculation immediately when changed. This "
"parameter is only visible if the :ref:`SERVO_FTW_MASK<SERVO_FTW_MASK>` "
"parameter has at least one bit set."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERVO_FTW_POLES<SERVO_FTW_POLES>` 参数用于选择电机电极数，用于计算电机 RPM。更改此参数后立即影响 "
"RPM 计算。只有当 :ref:`SERVO_FTW_MASK<SERVO_FTW_MASK>` 参数至少有一位被置位时，此参数才可见。"

