#: ../../source/docs/common-fettec-onewire.rst:195
#: 41cc19e3c8094413b9a8af3d190fbeb8
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fettec-onewire.rst:198
#: 1a1bfbd9796f4864917cfc2464a35e5b
msgid "ESCs keep initializing"
msgstr "ESC 持续初始化"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fettec-onewire.rst:198
#: f1acf8f41f734b2695a5d695b1cc9914
msgid ""
"If the flight-control is not receiving telemetry signals from every ESC, and"
" it is unarmed it reinitializes the ESCs until every ESC is configured "
"correctly. The FTW mask is used to determine the motor count that must be "
"found. Double check if the :ref:`SERVO_FTW_MASK<SERVO_FTW_MASK>` is "
"calculated correctly to fit the actual motor count."
msgstr ""
"如果飞控未收到每个 ESC 的数传信号且处于未解锁状态，它将重新初始化 ESC，直到每个 ESC 都正确配置。FTW "
"掩码用于确定必须发现的电机数量。请仔细检查 :ref:`SERVO_FTW_MASK<SERVO_FTW_MASK>` 是否与实际电机数量正确对应。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fettec-onewire.rst:200
#: d4cb34d9355e47e5bfdb460e3baeed0d
msgid "The ESCs are not initializing."
msgstr "ESC 未初始化。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fettec-onewire.rst:201
#: 6968b41c784b422393934829b7c256fc
msgid ""
"Check if the parameters are correct. Also make sure the telemetry pin is "
"connected, as it will not work without it."
msgstr "检查参数是否正确。同时确保数传引脚已连接，否则无法工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fettec-onewire.rst:204
#: 3a8bef010d3f425f8a36b0726c3bbca0
msgid "ESCs are not found in FETtec configurator."
msgstr "ESC 在 FETtec 配置工具中未被发现。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-fettec-onewire.rst:203
#: 65f9f4c3f48e4a988efb554547e20c71
msgid ""
"A halfduplex 2MBaud/s serial connection is required for the use with the "
"FETtec configurator, which is currently not supported by ArduPilot. You need"
" to use a external serial  device like a FETtec FC or a USB serial adapter. "
"Please disconnect the ArduPilot FC from the ESCs to find it in the FETtec "
"configurator."
msgstr ""
"使用 FETtec 配置工具需要半双工 2MBaud/s 串口连接，目前 ArduPilot 不支持此功能。您需要使用外部串口设备，如 FETtec "
"飞控或 USB 串口适配器。请将 ArduPilot 飞控从 ESC 断开，再在 FETtec 配置工具中查找。"
